      "settled_by_quote": "Your logic makes sense even if I disagree, and if you think this approach is better, I've acked the code change and don't want to get in the way."
    },
    {
      "id": "c:5108268588",
      "kind": "correctness",
      "harm": "generator expression resolves CONFIG/DEBUG postfixes, which would cause install failure if suffixed manpages do not exist in doc/man/",
      "quote": "the genex also picks up <CONFIG>_POSTFIX / DEBUG_POSTFIX... doc/man/ won't have a postfixed page, so you get an install-time failure only in that config",
